# ─── Groq AI ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Used by: api/ai/generate-recipe.ts (Vercel Serverless Function)
# Model:   llama-3.3-70b-versatile
#
# Get your free API key at: https://console.groq.com/keys
#
# LOCAL DEVELOPMENT:
#   1. Copy this file:  cp .env.example .env
#   2. Replace the placeholder with your real key
#   3. Run with Vercel CLI to also serve the API function:
#      vercel dev   (instead of npm run dev)
#
# PRODUCTION (Vercel):
#   Settings → Environment Variables → add GROQ_API_KEY
#   Then redeploy so the new variable is picked up.
#
# NOTE: The TheCocktailDB API (used for recipe browsing) does NOT require
# a key. The app works fully without this file — only the AI Generator
# feature needs GROQ_API_KEY.
#
GROQ_API_KEY=paste_your_groq_key_here